        "ts-3": {
          "visible": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "short": "Recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "body": "• **Unit tests** check one piece with doubles for the rest — fast enough to run thousands on every change.\n• **Integration tests** use real neighbours (a database in a container) to catch what doubles can’t.\n• **Contract tests** catch breaking API changes between teams, in the provider’s own build.\n• A few **end-to-end tests** cover the journeys that matter: keep the pyramid the right way up.\n• Fix **flaky** tests, and test for **load** and **failure**, not just correctness.",
      "callout": {
        "kind": "tip",
        "text": "Next up: **CI/CD & Deployments** — running all of this on every change, and getting it to production safely."
      },
